msgstr "Wakatsuki: Outside the entrance is safe. Only for now. In another two hours, this spot will be evil spirit heaven too."

#. event 26, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT13/e026/p1/t06"
msgid "美広　：でも、今は校舎の霊が全然・・・"
